Cache Consistency & Invalidation Internals
This is where caching becomes significantly harder.
We'll study:
Database
   ↓
Cache
and the dangerous races between them:
•	stale reads 
•	cache invalidation 
•	update-then-delete 
•	delete-then-update 
•	concurrent requests 
