24. A production-oriented pseudocode
Not framework-specific:
Result execute(Request request, Deadline deadline) {

    for (;;) {

        Result result = attempt(request);

        if (result.isSuccess()) {
            return result;
        }

        if (!isRetryable(result)) {
            throw result.toException();
        }

        if (!isIdempotent(request)) {
            throw result.toException();
        }

        if (!retryBudget.tryConsume()) {
            throw result.toException();
        }

        Duration remaining = deadline.remaining();

        Duration delay = calculateBackoffWithJitter();

        if (delay >= remaining) {
            throw result.toException();
        }

        sleep(delay);
    }
}
Notice what is not present:
maxAttempts = 3
as the entire strategy.
The retry decision is multidimensional.
