partitioning
consumer groups
replay
offset management
large-scale streaming
Redis Lists are a different abstraction.
So in an interview:
"Can Redis implement a queue?"
Yes.
But:
"Should Redis List replace Kafka for a high-volume durable event-streaming platform?"
Generally, no.
We'll later compare Redis patterns with Kafka-style systems.
