57. Example of Cache Stampede
Suppose:
100,000 users
all request:
product:123
The key expires at:
12:00:00
At:
12:00:01
100,000 requests arrive.
Before expiration:
Redis → product
After expiration:
Redis → MISS
Potentially:
100,000 requests
        ↓
100,000 DB queries
Your database can collapse.
