Suppose you're designing:
Spring Boot
     ↓
Redis
     ↓
PostgreSQL
You have:
Redis maxmemory = 8 GB
and:
maxmemory-policy = allkeys-lru
Cache:
product:{id}
with:
TTL = 30 minutes
Now:
1. Product requested
2. Redis HIT
3. TTL continues
Eventually:
