Redis treats it as expired.
Then:
GET
 ↓
MISS
 ↓
Spring Boot
 ↓
PostgreSQL
 ↓
SET Redis
 ↓
EXPIRE
But if Redis reaches:
8 GB
before keys naturally expire:
memory pressure
      ↓
allkeys-lru
      ↓
choose relatively least-recently-used key
      ↓
