21. Full vs partial synchronization
Feature	Full Sync	Partial Sync
Amount transferred	Large	Only missing portion
Cost	High	Low
New replica	Common	Usually not applicable initially
Temporary disconnect	Expensive	Ideal
Requires backlog	Not for initial full copy	Yes
Requires matching replication history	No	Yes
Impact	Network/CPU intensive	Much cheaper
