P2 → 4096 - 8191
P3 → 8192 - 12287
P4 → 12288 - 16383
The exact redistribution can vary, but the principle is:
Move slots, not the entire keyspace.
Only keys belonging to moved slots need to migrate.
This is one of the biggest reasons the slot abstraction is useful.
